Subject: [PATCH 3/3] docs(infer,msgbroker,inputselector): document the stats
 property

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docs/source/docs/Elements/03_02_DxInfer.md         | 1 +
 docs/source/docs/Elements/03_07_DxInputSelector.md | 1 +
 docs/source/docs/Elements/03_11_DxMsgBroker.md     | 1 +
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_02_DxInfer.md b/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_02_DxInfer.md
index 17fa316..cc0893c 100644
--- a/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_02_DxInfer.md
+++ b/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_02_DxInfer.md
@@ -79,6 +79,7 @@ GObject
 | `use-ort`          | Determines whether to use ONNX Runtime (ORT) for inference.                                          | Boolean   | `true`             |
 | `backend`          | Selects the inference backend: `auto` or `dxrt`.                                                     | Enum      | `auto`             |
 | `eos-drain-timeout` | How long an EOS (global or per-stream) waits for buffers still on the device before it is forwarded anyway, in nanoseconds. `0` waits indefinitely. | Unsigned Integer 64 | `5000000000` (5 s) |
+| `stats`            | Read-only. Buffers dropped without an error since start, by reason: `dropped-qos`, `dropped-throttled`, `dropped-no-meta`, `dropped-after-eos` (guint64 fields of `application/x-dxinfer-stats`). | GstStructure | — |
 
 
 ### **Example JSON Configuration**
diff --git a/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_07_DxInputSelector.md b/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_07_DxInputSelector.md
index 2bdb917..cea6e8f 100644
--- a/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_07_DxInputSelector.md
+++ b/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_07_DxInputSelector.md
@@ -49,6 +49,7 @@ GObject
 |-------------|---------------------------|-----------|--------------------|
 | `name`     | Sets the unique name of the DxInputSelector element.  | String   | `"dxinputselector0"`   |
 | `max-queue-size` | Maximum number of buffers to queue per input stream.  | Unsigned Integer | `2` |
+| `stats` | Read-only. `pads-skipped`: pads left out of a round because the live deadline passed (guint64 field of `application/x-dxinputselector-stats`). | GstStructure | — |
 
 !!! note "NOTE"  
 
diff --git a/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_11_DxMsgBroker.md b/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_11_DxMsgBroker.md
index c6ffe6b..7937f6b 100644
--- a/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_11_DxMsgBroker.md
+++ b/docs/source/docs/Elements/03_11_DxMsgBroker.md
@@ -47,6 +47,7 @@ GObject
 | `conn-info`      | Connection info in the format `host:port`. **Required**.             | String    | `null`             |
 | `topic`          | The topic name for publishing messages. **Required**.                | String    | `null`             |
 | `config`         | Path to the broker configuration file (optional).                    | String    | `null`             |
+| `stats`          | Read-only. Buffers rendered since start: `published`, `failed` (broker disconnected or send rejected), `no-message` (no message meta, expected with `message-interval` > 1). guint64 fields of `application/x-dxmsgbroker-stats`. | GstStructure | — |
 
 
 !!! note "NOTE" 
